UPDATE
  → to update existing data.
*the updated data should match the data type of the column in the table schema.

#Query
- UPDATE mytable
- SET column= value_or_expr, other_value_or_expr,...
- WHERE conditon;

Practice_problem_1
Q:- The Director for 'A Bug's Life' is incorrect, it was actually directed by John Lasseter

    - UPDATE Movie
    - SET Director= "John Lasseter"
    - WHERE id= 2;

Practice_problem_2
Q:- The year that Toy Story 2 was released is incorrect, it was actully released in 1999.

  - UPDATE Movies
  - SET Year= "1999"
  - WHERE id= 3;

Practice_Problem_3
Q:- Both the title and director for "Toy Story 8" is incorrect !
    The title should be "Toy Story 3" and it was directed by Lee Unkrich.

  - UPDATE Movies
  - SET Title= "Toy Story 3" , Directory= "Lee Unkrich"
  - WHERE id= 11;
